WEBVTT

00:00:21.746 --> 00:00:24.516
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.516 --> 00:00:27.452
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:29.688
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.688 --> 00:00:32.891
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:38.797
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.797 --> 00:00:43.401
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.401 --> 00:00:55.146
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.146 --> 00:01:00.886
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:06.558
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:12.230
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:17.402
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.402 --> 00:01:30.770
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:02:40.318 --> 00:02:43.188
- Hey, that car...
- What's up?

00:02:43.188 --> 00:02:47.192
Isn't that lgor's? I thought he went home.

00:02:47.192 --> 00:02:49.861
He's doing some more training tonight.

00:02:49.861 --> 00:02:52.897
Yeah? He's a hard worker.

00:02:52.897 --> 00:02:57.335
Yeah, I doubt he wants people
saying he only became the lead racer

00:02:57.335 --> 00:02:58.636
'cause Gerd's gone!

00:02:58.636 --> 00:03:03.141
Lgor was always hidden in the
shadow of Gerd's ass when racing!

00:03:03.141 --> 00:03:05.076
He also had a windbreak!

00:03:05.076 --> 00:03:07.712
All he ever did was
watch the real master at work!

00:03:07.712 --> 00:03:10.015
He never would've suddenly become top...

00:03:10.015 --> 00:03:12.313
- Hey!
- Lgor!

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.681
Damn...

00:03:26.664 --> 00:03:32.670
Damn it! I'm good enough to
be top racer, with or without Gerd!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.400
I will prove it!

00:03:42.981 --> 00:03:44.744
Is there still someone here?!

00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:49.847
Gerd?!

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:58.124
Is he out to get me, just like Matthew?!

00:04:08.173 --> 00:04:09.834
Dammit!

00:04:25.056 --> 00:04:28.082
He thinks nothing of me, then?!

00:04:32.497 --> 00:04:37.202
Igor was always hidden in the
shadow of Gerd's ass when racing!

00:04:37.202 --> 00:04:43.971
Damn you! Damn you, Gerd!
Even as a monster, you mock me!

00:04:57.856 --> 00:04:59.517
What?!

00:05:18.843 --> 00:05:22.870
With one lap left, Gerd
Frentzen remains at the lead!

00:05:24.449 --> 00:05:29.721
Frentzen pulls further away from
the pack and crosses the finish line!

00:05:29.721 --> 00:05:32.656
Gerd Frentzen is the winner!

00:05:53.611 --> 00:05:57.649
I guess he really is alive...

00:05:57.649 --> 00:06:02.020
He doesn't seem to be
back as a human, though...

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.789
We don't know that yet.

00:06:04.789 --> 00:06:09.283
If he's alive, I will bring Gerd back.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:16.401
So Gerd suddenly
attacked you during practice?!

00:06:16.401 --> 00:06:22.607
Yeah. He bust onto the course
and suddenly came rushing at me.

00:06:22.607 --> 00:06:26.144
Why would he attack you,
his former teammate?

00:06:26.144 --> 00:06:32.450
I don't know. He did attack
Coach Matthew and his girlfriend Jil.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.784
Maybe he's trying to kill
everyone who had been close to him.

00:06:53.271 --> 00:06:57.308
If he learns his girlfriend is
still alive, he might attack her again.

00:06:57.308 --> 00:07:00.869
Gerd is nothing but a monster now!

00:07:43.488 --> 00:07:47.358
You weren't bleeding, but I bandaged you up.

00:07:47.358 --> 00:07:49.260
That was a terrible burn.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.626
What's your name, mister?

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.565
Joseph.

00:07:54.565 --> 00:07:56.931
Want an apple, Joseph?

00:07:59.504 --> 00:08:01.706
Thanks.

00:08:01.706 --> 00:08:04.504
You gotta help people in trouble.

00:08:06.844 --> 00:08:11.916
Plus, you helped me
when I was in trouble before.

00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:13.611
So now it's my turn.

00:08:17.555 --> 00:08:19.318
That was you?

00:08:34.472 --> 00:08:37.875
She had fallen into a strong state of panic,

00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:40.411
but sedatives have calmed her down a bit.

00:08:40.411 --> 00:08:42.747
And her symptoms of
transforming into an Amalgam?

00:08:42.747 --> 00:08:44.649
They're continuing.

00:08:44.649 --> 00:08:50.555
Umm... Is the Amalgam Gerd
really going to come attack her?

00:08:50.555 --> 00:08:52.657
It's one possibility.

00:08:52.657 --> 00:08:56.694
This location hasn't been
made public, so I think we'll be fine.

00:08:56.694 --> 00:08:59.897
We've been assigned to
guard this place, just to be safe.

00:08:59.897 --> 00:09:01.699
I appreciate it.

00:09:01.699 --> 00:09:06.571
Just the idea she could become
an Amalgam makes me want to flee!

00:09:06.571 --> 00:09:09.440
Do you think Gerd will really come?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.809
Hermann, I know how you feel, but...

00:09:11.809 --> 00:09:16.881
I don't care. If he comes,
we can talk. Besides...

00:09:16.881 --> 00:09:20.151
...I'm not the only one who believes in him.

00:09:20.151 --> 00:09:24.850
Your little brother worked hard
on this letter. I have to give it to him.

00:09:38.736 --> 00:09:41.272
No!

00:09:41.272 --> 00:09:43.708
Stop! Stop, Gerd!

00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:48.613
No! It wasn't me! It wasn't
my fault! It was Matthew!

00:09:48.613 --> 00:09:51.182
Matthew wanted to trick you!

00:09:51.182 --> 00:09:54.419
It wasn't me! I didn't want to do it!

00:09:54.419 --> 00:09:57.789
It was Matthew! It wasn't my fault!

00:09:57.789 --> 00:10:02.827
Damn! I knew it! That bitch
did do something to Gerd!

00:10:02.827 --> 00:10:04.886
And that's why he...!

00:10:06.998 --> 00:10:12.103
Is it true XAT has quarantined
Gerd Frentzen's girlfriend Jil?!

00:10:12.103 --> 00:10:13.968
How is Jil-san?!

00:10:15.339 --> 00:10:18.443
Has she said anything about Frentzen?!

00:10:18.443 --> 00:10:20.645
Do you really think he'll come and attack?!

00:10:20.645 --> 00:10:22.977
No comment for everything!

00:10:26.717 --> 00:10:29.787
The press will learn about
the research ward eventually.

00:10:29.787 --> 00:10:31.789
Prepare to have her moved.

00:10:31.789 --> 00:10:33.381
Understood, sir.

00:10:53.978 --> 00:10:55.843
Heya, Malek!

00:10:58.549 --> 00:11:02.610
Ditching school so you can haul water?

00:11:14.298 --> 00:11:17.935
C'mon! Get up!

00:11:17.935 --> 00:11:21.769
Don't let us ever see you again!
You're possessed by a demon!

00:11:42.426 --> 00:11:46.328
Malek... Umm... Here...

00:11:47.265 --> 00:11:49.733
I bought a new one...

00:11:53.971 --> 00:11:55.598
Just go!

00:11:57.375 --> 00:12:00.344
They're your friends, aren't they?

00:13:33.404 --> 00:13:36.440
After attacking his
teammate, the living Demonic,

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:42.546
Gerd Frentzen, seems
to have disappeared again.

00:13:42.546 --> 00:13:47.084
Authorities appear to be taking
precautions against the possibility

00:13:47.084 --> 00:13:52.123
that he may again attack
his former lover, Jil Hoffman-san.

00:13:52.123 --> 00:13:58.996
Gerd Frentzen, as a true demon,
has now become a threat to us!

00:13:58.996 --> 00:14:02.266
He came for vengeance.

00:14:02.266 --> 00:14:05.758
Gerd came back for vengeance...

00:14:08.139 --> 00:14:12.439
He came back to bring
justice to all the bad guys.

00:14:14.679 --> 00:14:17.671
Here she comes! Jil Hoffman!

00:14:19.817 --> 00:14:23.921
The press out front is
following Squad 1's ambulance.

00:14:23.921 --> 00:14:26.190
The diversion tactic was a success!

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:28.793
Let's hope so. Let's go.

00:14:28.793 --> 00:14:30.158
Roger!

00:14:46.544 --> 00:14:48.205
What?!

00:14:49.346 --> 00:14:53.984
A vehicle with Jil Hoffman
inside is now on the move!

00:14:53.984 --> 00:14:56.153
- Damn it!
- The information's out?!

00:14:56.153 --> 00:14:58.556
Where are you taking Jil-san?!

00:14:58.556 --> 00:15:00.558
Is this a countermeasure against Gerd?!

00:15:00.558 --> 00:15:01.892
Shut up!

00:15:01.892 --> 00:15:03.094
Boss!

00:15:03.094 --> 00:15:07.064
There's no use turning back now.
We transport her as scheduled.

00:15:07.064 --> 00:15:08.199
Roger!

00:15:08.199 --> 00:15:10.968
Al! Brad! Keep them away!

00:15:10.968 --> 00:15:13.337
Yeah, we know!

00:15:13.337 --> 00:15:15.005
What you're seeing now

00:15:15.005 --> 00:15:20.144
is a CNS TV exclusive of Jil
Hoffman-san being transported!

00:15:20.144 --> 00:15:28.313
He'll need to be more active,
for Magwald Xargin's sake.

00:15:32.156 --> 00:15:34.124
Jil...

00:15:35.826 --> 00:15:37.384
Jil!

00:15:38.362 --> 00:15:40.531
N-No... No!

00:15:40.531 --> 00:15:41.732
What's going on?!

00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:43.597
Hey! Sedate her!

00:15:50.074 --> 00:15:51.008
Not good!

00:15:51.008 --> 00:15:52.777
Amanda! Hermann!

00:15:52.777 --> 00:15:54.108
What is it?!

00:15:59.049 --> 00:16:00.985
Mei-Fong! The ten-count!

00:16:00.985 --> 00:16:02.714
Roger!

00:16:08.125 --> 00:16:09.558
Escape!

00:16:19.203 --> 00:16:20.864
Boss!

00:16:28.179 --> 00:16:31.205
Damn! She completely demonized!

00:16:35.019 --> 00:16:36.418
That's...!

00:16:37.154 --> 00:16:42.459
S-Stop! I've done nothing wrong! I'm...!

00:16:42.459 --> 00:16:43.360
Stop!

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:46.530
Al! Brad! Hurry here! Jil's demonized!

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:50.261
Damn! Brad! Let's draw these guys away!

00:16:54.538 --> 00:16:56.733
Hermann! A tranquilizer shell!

00:16:59.376 --> 00:17:00.866
Gerd!

00:17:03.047 --> 00:17:05.709
- Gerd! Wait, Gerd! Stop!
- Hermann! Look out!

00:17:07.852 --> 00:17:09.286
Gerd!

00:17:09.286 --> 00:17:12.847
It's Gerd Frentzen! Gerd has appeared!

00:17:20.331 --> 00:17:24.301
N-No... Stay away!

00:17:24.301 --> 00:17:26.360
Stay away!

00:17:38.883 --> 00:17:40.544
Hermann!

00:18:09.179 --> 00:18:10.381
Hermann!

00:18:10.381 --> 00:18:12.508
It's no use! We can't get close!

00:18:25.195 --> 00:18:28.565
Is that justice for the wicked?

00:18:28.565 --> 00:18:30.533
Yes!

00:18:32.836 --> 00:18:36.966
All I see is him suffering.

00:18:58.896 --> 00:19:00.488
What?!

00:19:07.237 --> 00:19:08.534
Gerd...

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.542
You refuse to die, but
you're going down this time!

00:19:25.422 --> 00:19:26.724
Stop, Gerd!

00:19:26.724 --> 00:19:29.215
Damn monsters!

00:19:31.762 --> 00:19:33.753
Al! Brad!

00:19:38.202 --> 00:19:40.727
Please, stop! Champ!

00:19:51.882 --> 00:19:53.543
Gerd!

00:19:54.885 --> 00:19:56.876
Hermann?

00:20:00.624 --> 00:20:04.355
Please, come to your senses! Gerd!

00:20:09.933 --> 00:20:13.528
A young fan of yours wrote this.

00:20:27.684 --> 00:20:30.881
Gerd... You're a hero.

00:20:39.997 --> 00:20:42.022
Hero?

00:20:47.738 --> 00:20:49.137
Me?!

00:20:55.579 --> 00:20:57.206
Champ...

00:20:59.416 --> 00:21:00.713
Gerd!

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:04.819
Gerd!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.423
Gerd!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:18.802
The demonization hasn't gotten to his mind...

00:21:18.802 --> 00:21:21.202
Is he really...?

00:21:47.064 --> 00:21:54.938
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.938 --> 00:22:07.050
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:10.287
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:17.728
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.728 --> 00:22:22.232
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.232 --> 00:22:28.805
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.805 --> 00:22:34.178
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.178 --> 00:22:41.985
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:41.985 --> 00:22:48.325
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.325 --> 00:22:50.394
Wow wow

00:22:50.394 --> 00:22:58.402
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.402 --> 00:23:05.171
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.383 --> 00:23:18.288
Five minutes, thirty-two seconds.
A bright memory of days long gone.

00:23:18.288 --> 00:23:22.960
Even after everything has
been lost, something yet remains.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:27.364
Episode 6: "The Song that Pities the Demon."

00:23:27.364 --> 00:23:32.700
The fluttering checkered
flag is the hero's requiem.
